# FixCycle Environment Configuration Template
# ---------------------------------------------------------------
# IMPORTANT SECURITY RULE:
# 1. Copy this file to `.env.local` ONLY if you add optional services later.
#    `.env.local` is ignored by `.gitignore` and stays private on your machine.
# 2. FixCycle currently uses ZERO API keys (Leaflet + OpenStreetMap + localStorage).
# 3. NEVER put secret/private API keys in variables prefixed with `VITE_`!
#    Anything starting with `VITE_` is embedded into public browser JavaScript.
#    If you add a backend later (Node/Express), keep secret keys in server-only
#    environment variables (without `VITE_`) on the backend server only.

# Example server-side-only secret (do NOT use in React frontend directly):
# PRIVATE_API_KEY=your_private_key_here_never_commit
